#: ../../source/docs/common-frsky-mavlink.rst:14
#: 0cbd2f54e6df416fad53ec8e64cf433d
msgid "APM MavLink to FrSky SmartPort Converter (MavLink_FrSkySPort)"
msgstr "APM MAVLink 转 FrSky SmartPort 转换器（MavLink_FrSkySPort）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-frsky-mavlink.rst:16
#: 8fe3b324abce43a89c9453eb55260bf8
msgid ""
"There are several open source projects such that use small cpu boards, such "
"as the Teensy USB Development board, to convert MAVLink messages to "
"FrSkySmartPort format so that ArduPilot telemetry can be displayed on an "
"`OpenTX <https://www.open-tx.org/>`__ transmitter."
msgstr ""
"有多个开源项目使用 Teensy USB 开发板等小型 CPU 板将 MAVLink 消息转换为 FrSky SmartPort 格式，从而在 "
"`OpenTX <https://www.open-tx.org/>`__ 遥控器上显示 ArduPilot 数传。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-frsky-mavlink.rst:20
#: bc6b13f9ded442fb8926bb63afad6e89
msgid "Mav2PT Converter Project"
msgstr "Mav2PT 转换器项目"

#: ../../source/docs/common-frsky-mavlink.rst:22
#: 5c84f4ef3469458b8923cd0dfd0e1a32
msgid ""
"This project provides airborne (autopilot-> RX SPort), ground (TX module "
"telem output -> TX SPort input), and relay station applications using "
"inexpensive Teensy, ESP, ESP8266, and HelTec WIFI cpu boards. It also "
"provides Bluetooth and WIFI output options to allow parallel connections to "
"Ground Control stations in the ground and relay modes. It is currently well "
"supported."
msgstr ""
"该项目使用廉价的 Teensy、ESP、ESP8266 和 HelTec WIFI CPU 板，提供机载（飞控-> RX SPort）、地面（TX "
"模块数传输出 -> TX SPort 输入）和中继站应用。还提供蓝牙和 WIFI 输出选项，可在地面和中继模式下并行连接到地面控制站。目前维护良好。"

